                <pb facs="0807" n="797" sameAs="frus:frus1948v08/pg797"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">846G.79693/4–1548: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to the Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Stuart</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1948-04-22T17:00:00-05:00">April 22, 1948—5 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>613. Embs assumption correct reurtel 678 Apr 15, particularly in view last para
                    urtel 608 Apr 5. Repeated Shanghai as 734.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lovett</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
